The '''Cake Slice of the Century''' is a {{Special}} [[Memento]].

__TOC__
== Obtaining ==
A '''Cake Slice of the Century''' is rewarded to the player at the end of the [[Raffle of the Century]] if they have joined a team by talking to {{NPCSprite|Rezzus}}. The number of tickets the player has pooled and the name of the team they were on is displayed on the memento.

Additionally, the team the player was on affects the memento's lore and texture.
